      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the brand strategy for a new ultra-premium watch line—think Patek Philippe level stuff. We need to nail down the \"archetypal\" customer. Can you help me draft a detailed persona for the ideal client? I want to know their lifestyle, their background, what kind of vibe they carry, and what they value most. Just give me a deep dive into who this person is at their core.asap. . . sorry,. ignore the",
